# Normalize text to LF in the repo and check it out as LF on every platform.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true gives Windows checkouts CRLF working copies,
# which Biome (lineEnding defaults to "lf") flags as a format error in every
# file. Must precede the binary rules below so they take precedence.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pptx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
